<p>HubSpot's <code>hubspot_owner_id</code> reflects the <strong>current</strong> deal owner only. To identify ownership transfers during Q1 2025–Q2 2026, the <code>propertiesWithHistory</code> API must be called per deal for the <code>hubspot_owner_id</code> field — the same method used for close date history. <strong>This was not run in this pull.</strong> Deals with mid-cycle owner changes may have push attribution that spans two reps. To run this: enroll all 172 NA pushed deals in a batch API call fetching <code>hubspot_owner_id</code> history, then cross-reference the ownership change date against the push dates to flag split-attribution deals. <strong>[TBD: requires additional API run]</strong></p>
